:: MP Extra Deep Foghorn 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>暴雨拍打着海蚀暗穴外侧的引航石台，<<else>>退潮后的海蚀暗穴引航石台露出水面，<</if>>你在先前取得暗礁水文图的罗盘座下方发现了一道嵌着黄铜浮球阀的副暗渠，旁边的石槽里搁着一柄守塔人校准气压用的长柄铜扳手。<<if (($mpQuestShipwreck or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_foghorn_deep_chart'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 3 or ($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0) gte 2>>你对照沉船滩与旧雾角塔的潮位记号，一眼看出了浮球阀的开启刻度。<</if>>

<<if $mpClues["clue_foghorn_deep_chart"]>><span class="teal">对照先前从海蚀暗穴取得的暗礁水文图，你一眼认出了罗盘座下方副暗渠的潮位线。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep4_foghorn is 1>>
海蚀暗穴的副暗渠浮球阀今日已校验完毕，潮水在石槽间平稳回落。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-4">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋开浮球阀盖 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_foghorn to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_foghorn_4_rew")>><<money 420>>浮球阀盖应声旋开，内壁防潮筒里滑出一卷旧港引航员预留的航标补贴银币。<<else>>浮球阀内壁干燥整洁，你顺手核对了今日的潮位刻度。<</if>><span class="green">你摸清了雾角暗穴与外海沉船航道的联动水门。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	湿滑的海藻让铜扳手滑脱了半寸，冰冷海水溅湿了袖口。<span class="red">你甩干手背水珠退上石阶。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看图拨配重 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-4">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_foghorn to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_foghorn_deep_beacon"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_foghorn_deep_beacon"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_foghorn_4_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>配重块精准归位，暗渠底部的铜匣弹开，露出一袋未拆封的守塔巡检信物铜牌。<<else>>配重块运转顺滑，暗渠水声与灯塔雾角遥相呼应。<</if>><span class="green">你凭水文图刻度彻底校准了暗穴浮球。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗涌忽然顶起浮球，配重链条震麻了你的虎口。<span class="red">你扶住石壁稳住呼吸。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[探入暗穴尽头 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Clockwork 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>子夜时分的机括城档案馆密库深处，<<else>>机括城档案馆密库十二号柜后的暗室里，<</if>>你在先前取得主发条蓝图的铜匣底座下摸到了副调速器的三爪离合簧，旁边的铁架上挂着一壶精炼钟表油与一把游标卡尺。<<if (($mpQuestClocktower or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_clockwork_blueprint'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 2 or ($mpQuestElkWorkshop or 0) gte 2>>你想起钟表铺与地下工坊的擒纵齿比，很快算清了三爪离合簧的张力上限。<</if>>


<<if $mpClues["clue_clockwork_blueprint"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前收妥的主发条蓝图剖面线，你准确摸到了十二号柜后副调速器的三爪离合簧。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep4_clockwork is 1>>
密库暗室的副调速器离合簧今日已保养妥当，齿轮声匀净轻快。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-4">
<<investigateicon>><<link "量离合簧间隙 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_clockwork to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_4_rew")>><<money 440>>离合簧顺畅归位，调速器底槽弹出一盒封装完好的市政厅早期机工纪念币。<<else>>离合簧咬合紧密，你顺手记录下最新的摆频读数。<</if>><span class="green">你排除了机括城副调速器的卡滞隐患。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	离合簧回弹力道颇大，铜片边缘蹭红了你的指腹。<span class="red">你收回手指吹了吹热气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "润透主轴铜套 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_clockwork to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_clockwork_deep_governor"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_clockwork_deep_governor"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_4_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>钟表油渗入轴承，暗格无声滑开，露出一叠工匠行会留下的修缮奖贵宾铜牌。<<else>>轴承转动得悄无声息，整座暗室的机械共鸣愈发平稳。<</if>><span class="green">你以细腻手法完成了副调速器润滑。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	油滴落得急了些，在高速转动的齿轮边溅起几点油星。<span class="red">你拿绒布擦净护目镜片。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[推开暗室深入底层 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Abbey 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>湖面雨声透过修道院水下拱廊隐隐传来，<<else>>幽暗静谧的修道院水下石拱暗室里，<</if>>你在先前起出古老契约残页的石台背面发现了一座刻着七曜圣徽的青铜圣物匣，匣边石凹里摆着一枚调音音叉与一柄银质挑针。<<if (($mpQuestCatacomb or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_abbey_parchment'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 2>>你回忆起神殿地下墓穴的圣咏节拍，认出了七曜圣徽的按压次序。<</if>>


<<if $mpClues["clue_abbey_parchment"]>><span class="teal">对照先前在残廊暗格取得的古修道院羊皮卷，你看懂了圣骨龛下方排水石槽的铭文。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回暗河渡口 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep4_abbey is 1>>
水下石拱暗室的七曜圣物匣今日已启封查验，长明石灯静静燃烧。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-4">
<<templeicon>><<link "敲音叉 (0:07)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-4">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_abbey to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_abbey_4_rew")>><<money 430>>清越的共鸣声中圣物匣缓缓弹开，里面整齐码放着早年修会封存的渡口奉纳银币。<<else>>音叉余音在石拱间回荡，圣物匣内衬依然干燥如初。<</if>><span class="green">你借古修会音律解开了水下圣物匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石拱回音混杂着暗河水声，第一遍敲击没能对准共振节点。<span class="red">你按住音叉等回声散去。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回暗河渡口 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">>
<br>
<<link "拨开蜂蜡销 (0:08)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_abbey to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_abbey_deep_relig"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_abbey_deep_relig"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_abbey_4_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>蜂蜡销完好退下，匣底夹层里露出一卷附带修会私印的信物铜牌与手抄祷文。<<else>>蜂蜡封口平整依旧，你将内页抄文再次核对无误。<</if>><span class="green">你分毫未损地打开了圣物匣底夹层。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	水下暗室寒气逼人，冻僵的指尖让银挑针偏了半分。<span class="red">你搓热双手稳住心神。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到暗河渡口 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Ferry]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "锁簧与石面的回声">>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[步入圣骨内室 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜色下的温室地下冷香窖静谧无声，<<else>>恒温凉爽的温室地下冷香窖深处，<</if>>你在先前发现夜雾兰名录的蒸馏柜后方找到了一排贴着金箔封条的恒温玉瓷瓶，托盘上备着一只滴管量筒与一册温度折算表。<<if (($mpQuestGreenhouse or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_glasshouse_roster'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 2>>你结合先前查清的夜雾兰提纯配方，一眼认出中间那只玉瓷瓶装的是解香原液。<</if>>


<<if $mpClues["clue_glasshouse_roster"]>><span class="teal">按先前在育苗室暗屉翻出的名流认养花册，你在地下酿造室找到了对应的纯银蒸馏瓶。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回地下酿造室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep4_glasshouse is 1>>
冷香窖深处的恒温玉瓷瓶今日已取样封存，兰花冷香清冽怡人。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-4">
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link "调冷香阀 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_glasshouse to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_glasshouse_4_rew")>><<money 450>>阀门刻度稳稳停在最佳温区，托盘暗格自动弹出药师预留的配药酬金袋。<<else>>冷香窖温湿度分毫不差，玉瓷瓶中的原液澄澈透亮。<</if>><span class="green">你精准稳住了夜雾兰原液的窖藏温度。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷气从阀门缝隙逸出，冻得你手背微微发麻。<span class="red">你拉高袖口退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回地下酿造室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "取原液封管 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_glasshouse to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_glasshouse_deep_essence"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_glasshouse_deep_essence"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_glasshouse_4_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>原液分毫不差地注入样品管，你在瓶底绒垫下还摸出了名流买家预付的定金纪念铜牌。<<else>>样品管封口严密，清冽的草木香气让你头脑格外清明。<</if>><span class="green">你完美完成了冷香原液的无痕取样。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回兰花温室 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滴管内壁沾了一点水珠，你及时停手免得稀释了原液。<span class="red">你换过一支干燥滴管。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到地下酿造室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[走进酿造室最里间 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Blackiron 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>地面雨声顺着黑铁货运站盲段通风井传下，<<else>>黑铁货运站盲段水闸后的备用调度室里，<</if>>你在先前起出暗轨总表的铁柜侧面发现了一台仍通着弱电的穿孔发报机，桌角放着一盒黄铜校验插销与一本货运暗码簿。<<if (($mpQuestSmuggler or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_blackiron_manifest'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 2 or ($mpQuestUnderground or 0) gte 2>>你对照码头与下水道暗市的交接代号，立刻读懂了纸带上的发车班次。<</if>>


<<if $mpClues["clue_blackiron_manifest"]>><span class="teal">对照先前从装甲车暗格起出的机密押运货单，你认出了给水塔底座下那道联锁铁阀。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep4_blackiron is 1>>
盲段备用调度室的穿孔发报机今日已校验完毕，信号灯闪着稳定的绿光。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-4">
<<mptranslateicon>><<link "译纸带 (0:07)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-4">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_blackiron to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_blackiron_4_rew")>><<money 460>>你将译出的特快专列时刻抄录妥当，并从发报机底匣取出了值班调度员的备用津贴。<<else>>纸带上的穿孔编码清晰明了，你顺手整理好了归档卷轴。<</if>><span class="green">你彻底掌握了黑铁盲段的夜间发车时刻。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	纸带受潮有些发软，牵引齿轮卡了一下。<span class="red">你轻轻拨开压纸滚轮。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁件与道砟的响动">>
<br>
<<link "插三号孔 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_blackiron to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_blackiron_deep_waybill"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_blackiron_deep_waybill"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_blackiron_4_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>三号联锁孔绿灯亮起，侧面保险匣弹开，露出一叠加盖铁路钢印的押运纪念铜章券。<<else>>联锁机箱发出一声清脆的吸合声，备用轨道的信号切换得顺畅无阻。<</if>><span class="green">你用校验插销解锁了盲段备用联锁匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回蒸汽侧线 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	插销孔内积着一点煤灰，推入时卡在了半途。<span class="red">你拿毛刷扫去孔内煤灰。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
