<<link [[进入调度室 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Deep Druid 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜林深处的树心暗穴泛着柔和的萤石微光，<<else>>古德鲁伊石环树心暗穴的根须平台上，<</if>>你在先前寻得白桦星象图的石龛下方发现了一处盛满晨露的翡翠石盘，盘边放着一枚骨制挑针与一只装满古林灵芝孢子的皮囊。<<if (($mpQuestManorRuins or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_druid_birchmap'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 2 or ($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0) gte 2>>你印证着日晷庄园与月牙石台的方位刻度，看清了石盘底部的引水纹路。<</if>>


<<if $mpClues["clue_druid_birchmap"]>><span class="teal">顺着古根地穴那张白桦皮星象图的指引，你在石环北侧找到了被青苔掩盖的月泉副眼。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep4_druid is 1>>
树心暗穴的翡翠石盘今日已引露完毕，萤石微光映着翠绿苔痕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-druid-4">
<<mprepairicon>><<link "疏通引水星纹 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-druid-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_druid to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_4_rew")>><<money 440>>清冽晨露顺着星纹注满中心凹槽，石盘下方的根须缓缓让开，露出一袋守林长老留下的古银币。<<else>>晨露在翡翠石盘中流转自如，散发出令人心神宁静的草木清香。<</if>><span class="green">你疏通了树心暗穴的古德鲁伊引露盘。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石盘边缘的湿苔有些滑手，骨挑针在槽口偏了半分。<span class="red">你用干麻布擦净指尖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回林冠瞭望台 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "撒灵芝孢子入温床 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-druid-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep4_druid to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_druid_deep_seed"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_druid_deep_seed"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_4_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>孢子在晨露中舒展开来，旁边的树根暗格弹出一匣猎人行会收购珍稀药材的信物铜牌。<<else>>温床里的菌丝长势喜人，你细心替石盘盖上了透气白桦皮。<</if>><span class="green">你在树心温床培育出了古林灵芝菌丝。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回迷雾石柱 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	暗穴里的穿堂微风吹散了一撮孢子粉，让你轻轻打了个喷嚏。<span class="red">你侧身挡住风口定下神。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到林冠瞭望台 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[走向北侧日晷 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>华灯初上的天鹅绒暗层旋转舞台后台，<<else>>安静私密的天鹅绒暗层顶层金库外廊，<</if>>你在先前查获假面拍卖总账的密室深处发现了一扇嵌着双狐徽记的玫瑰木暗柜，柜台上放着一枚纯银调音钥与一盏紫晶验钞灯。<<if (($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_velvet_master_ledger'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 7>>总账上的包厢代号与柜门的音簧刻度一一对应，正是暗层幕后股东留下的备用分红柜。<</if>>


<<if $mpClues["clue_velvet_master_ledger"]>><span class="teal">翻开先前从后台带出的紫檀底账，你顺着夹页里的密道图摸进了海蚀崖底的私密交接室。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpVelvetQ8 is 1>>
玫瑰木暗柜的音簧锁今日已开启核验，丝绒内衬在暖光下泛着微光。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-8">
