<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpVelvetQ8 to 1>><<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 8)>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("velvet_mirage_8_rew")>><<money 520>>五枚音簧同时发出柔和共鸣，柜门悄然滑开，里面放着一叠不记名的贵宾包厢分红金券。<<else>>音簧共鸣清脆悦耳，柜中备用的假面徽章排列得整整齐齐。<</if>><span class="green">你凭总账代号开启了天鹅绒幕后分红柜。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	第三枚音簧张力略紧，拨动时发出一声轻微的杂音。<span class="red">你立刻按住簧片屏息倾听。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<link "烘显柜门密纹 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-8">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpVelvetQ8 to 1>><<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 8)>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_velvet_epilogue_seal"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_velvet_epilogue_seal"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("velvet_mirage_8_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>紫晶灯光下浮现出完整的荧光密码，你顺利打开底层抽屉，收下了拍卖行预留的特别纪念铜牌。<<else>>荧光暗记在紫晶灯下纤毫毕现，你将新的交接暗号默记于心。<</if>><span class="green">你借紫晶验钞灯破译了暗柜的荧光密文。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	紫晶灯罩的角度偏高，反光晃花了你的眼睛。<span class="red">你调暗灯芯揉了揉眼角。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[回到拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
