	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("observatory_wing_8_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>银质游标咔哒一声落入锁槽，暗格里滑出一枚镶嵌陨铁的纪念章与一笔校史编纂纪念铜章。<<else>>银质游标在星光下泛着温润光泽，整套星图的赤纬误差彻底归零。<</if>><span class="green">你凭建校星位开启了天球仪的陨铁暗格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
